#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:5 660c85380d524ae3b76fa4455d52b401
msgid "Acro Mode"
msgstr "Acro 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:7 bbfdda2d98a84a8aaec999b230a35f1b
msgid ""
"Acro mode uses the RC sticks to control the angular velocity of the copter "
"in each axis. Release the sticks and the vehicle will maintain its current "
"attitude and will not return to level (attitude hold). Acro mode is useful "
"for aerobatics such as flips or rolls, or FPV when smooth and fast control "
"is desired. Raising the :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` cutoff "
"frequency and retuning may allow better responsiveness, but appropriate "
"harmonic notch filtering to prevent noise impacts must be setup prior to "
"retuning. See :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering`  for more information."
msgstr ""
"Acro 模式使用 RC 摇杆控制飞机各轴的角速度。松开摇杆后飞机将保持当前姿态，不会自动回平（姿态保持）。Acro "
"模式适用于翻滚等特技飞行，或需要平滑快速控制的 FPV 飞行。提高 :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` "
"截止频率并重新调参可能提高响应速度，但必须在重新调参前设置适当的谐波陷波滤波器以防止噪声影响。详见 :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering`。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:14 faff08aef6e048a5b7a0f658ccb6dc72
msgid ""
"Pure rate mode stabilization, utilizing only the gyros with no attitude "
"feedback from the accelerometers, can be forced by setting bit 1 of "
":ref:`ACRO_OPTIONS<ACRO_OPTIONS>` to one. Attitude will still have an open "
"loop correction applied in this mode, similar to \"heading hold\" tail "
"gyros, but attitude can drift over time."
msgstr ""
"可通过将 :ref:`ACRO_OPTIONS<ACRO_OPTIONS>` 的位 1 设为 1 "
"来强制使用纯速率模式稳定，该模式仅使用陀螺仪而不使用加速度计的姿态反馈。在此模式下仍会施加开环姿态修正（类似\"航向保持\"尾陀螺），但姿态会随时间漂移。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:18 ac43ed66a6b7493cba2c423328010ff1
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:20 7ded2470429c441eaf814a3f5eb899d6
msgid ""
"The throttle is completely manual with no compensation for tilt angle of the"
" vehicle. If the pilot puts the throttle completely down the motors will go "
"to their minimum rate and stabilization will cease.However, this behavior "
"can be changed by enabling :ref:`airmode`"
msgstr ""
"油门完全手动，不对飞行器倾斜角度进行补偿。若飞手将油门完全压下，电机将转至最低转速，稳定化将停止。但可通过启用 :ref:`airmode` 改变此行为"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:24 17387fcae3ad41dea757803015c7bbe9
msgid ""
"Copter includes an Acro Trainer functionality that can be turned on/off to "
"make learning to fly Acro easier."
msgstr "Copter 包含 Acro 训练器功能，可开启/关闭以降低学习 Acro 飞行的难度。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:26 f77883a904b44628b133b271c39b0217
msgid ""
"Stick inputs are interpreted in the \"body frame\" (as opposed to Sport mode"
" in which they are \"earth frame\"). The difference between \"body frame\" "
"and \"earth frame\" is most obvious when the vehicle is leaned over. For "
"example when pitched forward at 45 degrees, when left yaw is applied if "
"using an earth frame controller (i.e. Sport mode) the copter will maintain "
"its pitch and roll angles as its heading changes. With a body frame "
"controller like Acro it will rotate about the vehicle's vertical axis "
"meaning the pitch angle will become the roll angle and the roll angle will "
"become the pitch angle."
msgstr ""
"摇杆输入以\"机体坐标系\"解释（与 Sport "
"模式的\"地球坐标系\"不同）。\"机体坐标系\"和\"地球坐标系\"的区别在飞行器倾斜时最为明显。例如，飞机向前倾斜 45 "
"度时，若使用地球坐标系控制器（即 Sport 模式）施加左偏航，飞机将在改变航向时保持俯仰和横滚角度；而使用机体坐标系控制器（如 "
"Acro），飞机将绕自身垂直轴旋转，即俯仰角变为横滚角，横滚角变为俯仰角。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:38 73d13177eeff4da1bb3f1b517ac6e186
msgid ""
"Acro is the most difficult flight mode to master and you can look forward to"
" crashing multiple times before you get the hang of it. While Acro mode does"
" not necessarily require GPS, switching to RTL in case of emergency does. "
"Make sure you do have a reliable position estimate prior to arming, most "
"commonly provided by 3D GPS fix with sufficient HDOP."
msgstr ""
"Acro 是最难掌握的飞行模式，在熟练之前可能会坠毁多次。虽然 Acro 模式不一定需要 GPS，但紧急情况下切换到 RTL 需要 "
"GPS。请确保在解锁前有可靠的位置估计，通常需要具有足够 HDOP 的 3D GPS 定位。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:46 1ce6c66ddd674a4a9f5dac8a218e31bf
msgid ""
"The above video was filmed in ACRO mode using :ref:`FPV goggles <common-fpv-"
"first-person-view>`."
msgstr "上述视频使用 :ref:`FPV 眼镜 <common-fpv-first-person-view>` 在 ACRO 模式下拍摄。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:51 bc08f61f49b74a2ea53d76f4122f3627
msgid "AirMode"
msgstr "AirMode"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:53 763b0b93b8be4affa51db0badd059309
msgid ""
"Acro mode can be setup to provide full stabilization at idle throttle. See "
":ref:`airmode`"
msgstr "Acro 模式可设置为在空转油门下提供完整稳定化。参见 :ref:`airmode`"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:58 c009a1afd91a43d4a805e26d8a17dbf6
msgid "Acro Trainer"
msgstr "Acro 训练器"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:60 d8f17a41bed341e282ee2207551e6708
msgid "The :ref:`ACRO_TRAINER <ACRO_TRAINER>` parameter can be set to:"
msgstr ":ref:`ACRO_TRAINER <ACRO_TRAINER>` 参数可设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:62 5356a5a21e474b028cc5676fea7d96d6
msgid ""
"0 = disabled. This means the pilot operates in full Rate control with no "
"automatic leveling nor angle-limiting performed by the autopilot."
msgstr "0 = 禁用。飞手以完整速率控制操作，飞控不进行自动调平或角度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:64 5e718ed789d74b4b939d6200daa152c3
msgid ""
"1 = automatic leveling. The vehicle will automatically return to the level "
"when the pilot releases the sticks. The aggressiveness with which it returns"
" to level can be controlled with the :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` and"
" :ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` parameters. The default of 1.0 will "
"cause it to return to level at up to 30deg/sec. Higher values will make it "
"return more quickly."
msgstr ""
"1 = 自动调平。当飞手松开摇杆时飞行器将自动恢复水平。恢复水平的激进程度可通过 :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>`"
" 和 :ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` 参数控制。默认值 1.0 将以最高 30 "
"度/秒的速率恢复水平，较高值将使恢复更快。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:70 5537c09abbed4f048b9f0dea3d9b2b3a
msgid ""
"2 (Default) = automatic leveling and lean angle limited. Includes the "
"automatic leveling as option #1 but in addition the vehicle will not lean "
"more than 45 degrees (this angle can be configured with the "
":ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` parameter)."
msgstr ""
"2（默认）= 自动调平且倾斜角受限。包含选项 #1 的自动调平功能，并额外限制飞行器倾斜不超过 45 度（此角度可通过 "
":ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>` 参数配置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:75 5b95998bafbe4e8bbf016bc8fb341964
msgid ""
"The trainer can be enabled/disabled using the Ch7/Ch8 switches or a channel "
"setup via its ``RCx_OPTION`` parameter.  With a 3 position switch the off "
"position (i.e. PWM < 1200) will disable the trainer, middle position will "
"enable option #1 (automatic leveling) and the top position (i.e. PWM > 1800)"
" will enable option #2 (leveling and lean angle limited). With a 2 position "
"switch only options #0 (disabled) and option #2 (leveling & limited) are "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"训练器可通过 Ch7/Ch8 开关或通过 ``RCx_OPTION`` 参数设置的通道启用/禁用。三段开关时，关闭位置（即 PWM < "
"1200）禁用训练器，中间位置启用选项 #1（自动调平），最高位置（即 PWM > 1800）启用选项 #2（调平并限制倾斜角）。两段开关时只有选项 "
"#0（禁用）和选项 #2（调平+限制）可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:86 558360877cb241f4bb919c99e87c9358
msgid "Traditional Helicopters"
msgstr "传统直升机"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:88 c3c636c4f5344eb384fe6f8c850c2a6e
msgid ""
"For Traditional Helicopters, this modes operates the same. However, "
"experienced pilots might find that this mode has a slightly robotic feel, "
"and attitude jumps as it lifts from the skids that they are not familiar "
"with. In Copter-4.0 and later, a \"Virtual Flybar\" feature has been "
"introduced, that simulates the classic feel of a flybar helicopter. By "
"setting the :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` and "
":ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` parameters to non-zero values, this "
"feature takes effect."
msgstr ""
"对于传统直升机，此模式的操作方式相同。不过，经验丰富的飞手可能会觉得该模式有些\"机械感\"，且在离地瞬间姿态会有跳变，令他们感到陌生。在 "
"Copter-4.0 及更新版本中，引入了\"虚拟飞杆\"功能，模拟经典飞杆直升机的飞行手感。将 "
":ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` 和 :ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` "
"参数设置为非零值即可激活此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:90 f5da2b62845a4aba97e9bf878530eb1c
msgid ""
"The Virtual Flybar will add decay term to the attitude controller to bleed "
"off accumulated differences between the current attitude and accumulated "
"commanded attitude, if the copter has not quickly obtained it, such as when "
"sitting on the ground but stick inputs are being given. Otherwise, when the "
"helicopter clears it will jump to the accumulated commanded attitude when "
"skids clear, perhaps surprisingly. This is familiar to Multicopter pilots."
msgstr ""
"虚拟飞杆会在姿态控制器中添加衰减项，以消除当前姿态与累积指令姿态之间的偏差——例如在地面上时仍给出摇杆输入却未能快速跟随的情况。否则，直升机离地时将跳变到累积的指令姿态，可能令人意外。这对多旋翼飞手来说是熟悉的体验。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:92 b257eb31e7ca4d4587921ca590b06ae1
msgid ""
"Values for :ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` and "
":ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` parameters ~ 2, will usually give good"
" results."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACRO_BAL_ROLL<ACRO_BAL_ROLL>` 和 :ref:`ACRO_BAL_PITCH<ACRO_BAL_PITCH>` "
"参数值约为 2 通常可获得良好效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:94 8ef5d2586758434babae88a2b5a2a2e8
msgid ""
"This feature is not active when :ref:`ACRO_TRAINER<ACRO_TRAINER>` is active"
msgstr "当 :ref:`ACRO_TRAINER<ACRO_TRAINER>` 激活时，此功能不生效"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:97 85812a346e3a425db5abf29dffa2b4bc
msgid "Tuning Parameters"
msgstr "调参参数"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:99 37c458277ce345eebcfaba9e949d8ffd
msgid ""
":ref:`ACRO_RP_RATE<ACRO_RP_RATE>` controls the rotation rate for the roll "
"and pitch axis. The default, 4.5, will command a 200deg/sec rotation rate. "
"Higher values lead to higher rotation rates, lower to slower rotation rates."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACRO_RP_RATE<ACRO_RP_RATE>` 控制横滚和俯仰轴的旋转速率。默认值 4.5 将指令 200 "
"度/秒的旋转速率。较高值对应较高旋转速率，较低值对应较低旋转速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:102 710cb07b93484ab1b5b5922fc9f113ac
msgid ""
":ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` controls the rotation rate for the yaw axis."
" The default, 4.5, like roll and pitch, will command a 200deg/sec rotation "
"rate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` 控制偏航轴的旋转速率。默认值 4.5 与横滚和俯仰相同，将指令 200 "
"度/秒的旋转速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:104 c97cbf4f9d2f462d8e7dd25445eafec6
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`ACRO_RP_EXPO <ACRO_RP_EXPO>` and :ref:`ACRO_Y_EXPO <ACRO_Y_EXPO>` are "
"an amount of Exponential to apply to the pilots stick inputs that only "
"applies to ACRO mode. By default, ACRO mode is much more responsive, even in"
" the center-sticks positions, than the other modes, so this parameter allows"
" the pilot to fine-tune stick response in the control to match what they "
"feel when they are in other modes such as Stabilize, AltHold, PosHold, etc. "
"The default value of 0 applies 30% expo to Roll and Pitch demands from the "
"pilot."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACRO_RP_EXPO <ACRO_RP_EXPO>` 和 :ref:`ACRO_Y_EXPO <ACRO_Y_EXPO>` 是仅适用于 "
"ACRO 模式的摇杆输入指数量。默认情况下，ACRO 模式即使在摇杆中位时响应也比其他模式灵敏得多，因此此参数允许飞手微调摇杆响应，使其与 "
"Stabilize、AltHold、PosHold 等模式的手感一致。默认值 0 对飞手的横滚和俯仰指令施加 30% 指数。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:114 c8121830a42a47b1af73fcdae091be1f
msgid "Advanced Tuning Parameters"
msgstr "高级调参参数"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:116 49b7efe724bd490ea0ab5be25dfd231c
msgid ""
"After you have become very confident with flying in ACRO mode, you may want "
"to go deeper in to tuning it based on your vehicle's performance "
"characteristics. These parameters should be adjusted by advanced users only "
"with the intent of removing \"bounce\" after very fast roll or flip "
"maneuvers on a vehicle that you are confident is very well tuned. Note that "
"these parameters are global parameters that apply to all flight modes, not "
"just ACRO."
msgstr ""
"在对 ACRO "
"模式飞行非常熟练之后，您可能希望根据飞行器性能特性进行更深入的调参。这些参数仅供高级用户调整，目的是消除经充分调参的飞行器在快速翻滚或横滚机动后的\"回弹\"现象。请注意，这些参数是全局参数，适用于所有飞行模式，而非仅限于"
" ACRO。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:124 8edd941050734986a3952c44914a4975
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` and :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`: Maximum acceleration in roll/pitch axis measured in "
"Centi-degres/sec/sec. Let's say you have a highly nimble quadcopter and you "
"have your :ref:`ACRO_RP_RATE<ACRO_RP_RATE>` parameter set to 9, which "
"translates to a roll request of ~400deg/sec. The copter is not physically "
"capable of going from 0deg/sec to 400deg/sec without a brief moment of "
"acceleration. During that time, error is building up in the controller in "
"order to get you to 400deg/sec. When you let off the sticks, that error can "
"still be present, resulting in an overshoot of desired attitude, followed by"
" a bounce-back. This parameter can be tuned to help remove that error during"
" the maneuver and soften if not remove the bounce-back. Note that this is "
"completely different from tuning the Rate D terms for Pitch and Roll, and "
"should come only after those terms are properly tuned."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX>` 和 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX "
"<ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX>`：横滚/俯仰轴的最大角加速度，单位为百分度/秒/秒。假设您有一架极为灵活的四旋翼，:ref:`ACRO_RP_RATE<ACRO_RP_RATE>`"
" 设为 9（对应约 400 度/秒的横滚请求）。飞行器物理上无法从 0 度/秒瞬间达到 400 "
"度/秒，需要短暂加速过程。在此期间，控制器会积累误差以达到 400 "
"度/秒。松开摇杆时，该误差仍可能存在，导致姿态超调并出现回弹。此参数可调整以消除机动过程中的误差并软化甚至消除回弹。请注意，这与调整横滚和俯仰的速率 D"
" 项完全不同，应在正确调整 D 项之后再进行此调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:139 fc23d757efd34fbea3dc2f8896d273bc
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`: Maximum acceleration in Yaw axis "
"measured in Centi-degress/sec/sec. Same principle as ``ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX`` and"
" :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX` but on the YAW axis based on the "
":ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` parameter value (likely a much lower, more "
"attainable value.)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX>`：偏航轴的最大角加速度，单位为百分度/秒/秒。原理与 "
"``ATC_ACCEL_R_MAX`` 和 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_P_MAX` 相同，但基于 "
":ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` 参数值（通常是更低、更易实现的值）作用于偏航轴。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:143 275b89a69c87425ab0f5d4d46f3fce73
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAN <ATC_THR_MIX_MAN>`: Balance between attitude and "
"throttle control. This value can be increased to improve attitude control "
"when the throttle is cut for better Airmode handling, however a stable tune "
"is essential before it can be increased."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAN "
"<ATC_THR_MIX_MAN>`：姿态控制与油门控制之间的平衡。可增大此值以改善油门切断时的姿态控制，从而更好地支持 "
"Airmode，但必须在飞行器调参稳定之后才能增大。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:148 593bc7d1e3ae4bf6bad18db6b627a5b5
msgid "User Videos"
msgstr "用户视频"
